गीत गाते हुए उपज एकत्र करेंगे.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"वह, जो रोते हुए बीजारोपण","poem":1},{"text":"के लिए बाहर निकलता है,","poem":2},{"text":"अपने साथ पूले लेकर","poem":1},{"text":"हर्ष गीत गाता हुआ लौटेगा.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":64,"caller":"+","text":"समृद्धि लौटा लाइए अर्थात् हमारे बंदियों को ज़ियोन लौटा लाइए","reference":{"chapter":126,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/hin_cvb/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/hin_cvb/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/hin_cvb/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}